+<h2 id="earthen">Earthen Constructed Sentences</h2>
+
+<p>Based on the grammar in <a href="earthen/grammar.md">earthen/grammar.md</a>.
+Key patterns used: *Khaz-* toponymic prefix (Titan-derived); *Dorn-* / *-dar* land/realm root;
+*Bael-* stone/earth morpheme; *-grim* fierce/helmet element; right-headed compounding
+(inherited from Titan). Earthen has <strong>no attested sentences at all</strong> — the entire
+corpus consists of proper names and place names. All constructions below are compound
+juxtapositions using inferred morphemes.</p>
+
+<table>
+<tr><th>#</th><th>Sentence</th><th>IPA</th><th>Gloss</th><th>Grammar Used</th></tr>
+
+<tr class="non-canon">
+  <td>Ea1</td>
+  <td>Khaz-Algar, Dorn-ogal.</td>
+  <td class="ipa">/kæz ˈælgɑːr ˈdɔːrnəɡɑːl/</td>
+  <td>Forge of Algar, Land of Ogal.</td>
+  <td>Attested *Khaz Algar* + attested *Dornogal*; juxtaposition of two confirmed place names showing the *Khaz-* and *Dorn-* toponymic prefixes</td>
+</tr>
+
+<tr class="non-canon">
+  <td>Ea2</td>
+  <td>Bael-grim, Dorn-dar.</td>
+  <td class="ipa">/ˈbeɪlɡrɪm ˈdɔːrndɑːr/</td>
+  <td>Stone-fierce, Land-realm.</td>
+  <td>Attested *Baelgrim* (Earthen name) + coined *Dorndar* (*Dorn-* + *-dar*, combining two inferred land/realm morphemes); <strong>speculative</strong> — assumes *Dorn-* and *-dar* can combine</td>
+</tr>
+
+<tr class="non-canon">
+  <td>Ea3</td>
+  <td>Gundar-gaz, Khaz-dun.</td>
+  <td class="ipa">/ˈɡʊndɑːrɡæz kæzˈdʌn/</td>
+  <td>[Gundar]-settlement, Forge-fortress.</td>
+  <td>Attested *Gundargaz* (Machine Speakers settlement) + coined *Khaz-dun* (*Khaz-* = forge + Dwarven *-dun* = fortress); <strong>highly speculative</strong> — cross-morpheme compound combining Earthen and Dwarven elements</td>
+</tr>
+
+<tr class="non-canon">
+  <td>Ea4</td>
+  <td>Eir-ich, Bel-edar.</td>
+  <td class="ipa">/ˈaɪrɪk bɛˈlɛdɑːr/</td>
+  <td>Guardian-[suffix], [Bel]-realm.</td>
+  <td>Attested *Eirich* (Machine Speaker) + attested *Beledar* (Hallowfall crystal); juxtaposition of personal name and place name; *Eir-* = guardian(?) + *-dar* = realm</td>
+</tr>
+
+<tr class="non-canon">
+  <td>Ea5</td>
+  <td>Uld-aman, Bael-dun.</td>
+  <td class="ipa">/ˈʌldɑmɑn ˈbeɪldʌn/</td>
+  <td>Titan-vault, Stone-fortress.</td>
+  <td>Attested Titan *Uldaman* + attested Dwarven *Bael'dun*; both relate to Earthen heritage (Uldaman = where Earthen were shaped, *Bael'dun* = stone fortress); juxtaposition of two places connected to Earthen history</td>
+</tr>
+
+<tr class="non-canon">
+  <td>Ea6</td>
+  <td>Skar-dyn, Khaz-modan.</td>
+  <td class="ipa">/ˈskɑːrdɪn kæzmoʊˈdɑːn/</td>
+  <td>Shadow-people, Forge-mountain.</td>
+  <td>Attested *Skardyn* (corrupted Earthen) + attested *Khaz Modan* (Dwarven kingdom); juxtaposition of corrupted and uncorrupted Earthen descendants; *Skar-* = shadow/corrupt vs. *Khaz-* = forge/craft</td>
+</tr>
+</table>
+
