+<h3>Cross-Family Phonological Comparison</h3>
+
+<table>
+<tr><th>Feature</th><th>Murloc (Nerglish)</th><th>Jinyu</th><th>Ankoan</th><th>Kobyss</th></tr>
+<tr><td>Syllable structure</td><td>Syllabic consonants; mrgl- patterns</td><td>Full CV/CVC</td><td>Full CV/CVC</td><td>English compounds only</td></tr>
+<tr><td>Vowel inventory</td><td>Restricted (mostly /ɜ/, /ʌ/)</td><td>Full /a e i o u/</td><td>Full /a e i o u/</td><td>N/A (no native names)</td></tr>
