 <h2 id="phonology">Phonological Observations</h2>
 
 <h3>Sound Inventory</h3>
-<p><strong>Consonants</strong>: ch (/tʃ/), d, dh (/ð/), g, h, k, l, m, n, ng (/ŋ/), r, s, t, th (/θ/), v, y (/j/), zh (/ʒ/)</p>
